Fundamento de Esperanto
=======================

The text of the Fundamento de Esperanto (L. L. Zamenhof, 1905) is in the
public domain. Its author died in 1917; copyright in the work has expired.

All other material in this repository — the Markdown and JSON/CSV
conversions, their structure, the build script and the documentation — is
dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
Public Domain Dedication:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

To the extent possible under law, the contributors have waived all copyright
and related or neighboring rights to this material. You may copy, modify,
distribute and use it, including for commercial purposes, without asking
permission and without attribution.
